{"id":"10608c2a55a773a6","group":"29","path":"29/29-df-generalized-quantifier.md","title":"查询诱导的广义量词","display":"df-generalized-quantifier — 查询诱导的广义量词","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-df-generalized-quantifier","aliases":["29-df-generalized-quantifier"],"display":"df-generalized-quantifier — 查询诱导的广义量词","depends_on":["[[29-df-term-interpretation]]","[[29-df-structure]]","[[29-df-fo-query]]","[[29-df-variable]]","[[29-df-formula]]","[[29-df-assignment]]","[[29-df-satisfaction]]","[[29-df-free-variable]]","[[29-df-relational-vocab]]"],"source_locator":"Definition 11.20, p.178, DjVu scan193; Definition1.26 pp.18–19 scans33–34","source_basis":"扫描193原图与文本已对照；参数、嵌套语法和合法输入域为显式重构","revision_basis":"本次仅据用户提供的29.zip修订；原source_locator及过去核对叙述为继承记录，未重新取得或查看DjVu原件","revision_verification":"数学接口审查及静态结构/链接检查；未提交证明助理内核证书"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-df-generalized-quantifier"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-df-generalized-quantifier</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-generalized-quantifier — 查询诱导的广义量词"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"76bbac386a4be5a3\" href=\"?note=76bbac386a4be5a3\" title=\"29-df-term-interpretation\">29-df-term-interpretation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0ac4b9a122d458e2\" href=\"?note=0ac4b9a122d458e2\" title=\"29-df-structure\">29-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"75340800e8905793\" href=\"?note=75340800e8905793\" title=\"29-df-fo-query\">29-df-fo-query</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ad08b66c5e54a436\" href=\"?note=ad08b66c5e54a436\" title=\"29-df-variable\">29-df-variable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a3fa1d78e657e6a2\" href=\"?note=a3fa1d78e657e6a2\" title=\"29-df-formula\">29-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"ac5c4072279f0088\" href=\"?note=ac5c4072279f0088\" title=\"29-df-assignment\">29-df-assignment</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"3ee556c64b16809b\" href=\"?note=3ee556c64b16809b\" title=\"29-df-satisfaction\">29-df-satisfaction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"db2b32546860e623\" href=\"?note=db2b32546860e623\" title=\"29-df-free-variable\">29-df-free-variable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"44836019093a45c6\" href=\"?note=44836019093a45c6\" title=\"29-df-relational-vocab\">29-df-relational-vocab</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Definition 11.20, p.178, DjVu scan193; Definition1.26 pp.18–19 scans33–34"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"扫描193原图与文本已对照；参数、嵌套语法和合法输入域为显式重构"},{"key":"revision_basis","html":"本次仅据用户提供的29.zip修订；原source_locator及过去核对叙述为继承记录，未重新取得或查看DjVu原件"},{"key":"revision_verification","html":"数学接口审查及静态结构/链接检查；未提交证明助理内核证书"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Var}\">\\(\\mathrm{Var}\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"ad08b66c5e54a436\" href=\"?note=ad08b66c5e54a436\" title=\"29-df-variable\">29-df-variable</a> 的个体变量集；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_\\sigma\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_\\sigma\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"a3fa1d78e657e6a2\" href=\"?note=a3fa1d78e657e6a2\" title=\"29-df-formula\">29-df-formula</a> 的FO公式集。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal V\\)</span> 是有限关系词汇的集合，允许个体常量、不含函数符号。为每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in\\mathcal V\">\\(\\sigma\\in\\mathcal V\\)</span> 指定同构封闭的合法输入类 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D_\\sigma\\subseteq\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\sigma]\">\\(\\mathcal D_\\sigma\\subseteq\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\sigma]\\)</span>。所有结构有限非空；取全体结构或固定标准数值结构均须在开始时指定。本条的集合与递归在元语言中解释。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau=\\langle R_1^{(a_1)},\\ldots,R_r^{(a_r)},c_1,\\ldots,c_s\\rangle\\in\\mathcal V\">\\(\\tau=\\langle R_1^{(a_1)},\\ldots,R_r^{(a_r)},c_1,\\ldots,c_s\\rangle\\in\\mathcal V\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq\\mathcal D_\\tau\">\\(S\\subseteq\\mathcal D_\\tau\\)</span> 同构封闭，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf s=(\\tau,S)\">\\(\\mathbf s=(\\tau,S)\\)</span>。下标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf s,\\mathfrak D\">\\(\\mathbf s,\\mathfrak D\\)</span> 中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak D=(\\mathcal D_\\sigma)_{\\sigma\\in\\mathcal V}\">\\(\\mathfrak D=(\\mathcal D_\\sigma)_{\\sigma\\in\\mathcal V}\\)</span> 固定全部合法论域。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in\\mathcal V\">\\(\\sigma\\in\\mathcal V\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(j\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathcal D_\\sigma\">\\(A\\in\\mathcal D_\\sigma\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(A)\">\\(\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(A)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a=\\max(\\{1\\}\\cup\\{a_i:1\\leq i\\leq r\\})\">\\(a=\\max(\\{1\\}\\cup\\{a_i:1\\leq i\\leq r\\})\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf X=(\\bar x_1,\\ldots,\\bar x_a)\">\\(\\mathsf X=(\\bar x_1,\\ldots,\\bar x_a)\\)</span> 的每个分量是长度 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 的个体变量元组；合法性由下式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal X_{k,a}\">\\(\\mathcal X_{k,a}\\)</span> 限定。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi=(\\phi_0,\\phi_1,\\ldots,\\phi_r,\\psi_1,\\ldots,\\psi_s)\">\\(\\Phi=(\\phi_0,\\phi_1,\\ldots,\\phi_r,\\psi_1,\\ldots,\\psi_s)\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{rng}\">\\(\\operatorname{rng}\\)</span> 取元组分量集合；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta[\\bar b/\\bar x_h]\">\\(\\beta[\\bar b/\\bar x_h]\\)</span> 同时把元组 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar x_h\">\\(\\bar x_h\\)</span> 的各坐标赋为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar b\">\\(\\bar b\\)</span> 的对应坐标。多个变量组同时更新时也逐坐标进行；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf X\\in\\mathcal X_{k,a}\">\\(\\mathsf X\\in\\mathcal X_{k,a}\\)</span> 保证更新坐标互不冲突。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Spec}_k^j[\\sigma,\\tau]\">\\(\\mathrm{Spec}_k^j[\\sigma,\\tau]\\)</span> 中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z\">\\(Z\\)</span> 由集合构造内部的存在量词绑定；它是自由参数集的有限上界，并与所有被绑定坐标不交。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>生成与满足同时按有限公式树递归：构造 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j+1\">\\(j+1\\)</span> 层的量词节点时，其全部公式体属于已经解释的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\">\\(j\\)</span> 层。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}\\)</span> 的FO子句和满足关系的FO子句沿用所列来源；下式给出新增子句。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota\">\\(\\iota\\)</span> 只对存在唯一见证使用。结构以其载体及全部符号解释的元组编码，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varnothing\\notin\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\">\\(\\varnothing\\notin\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\)</span>；下式仅将它用作非法解释的返回值。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>以下核心递归中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_{\\sigma}\">\\(\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_{\\sigma}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\phi,\\psi\">\\(\\phi,\\psi\\)</span> 属于本条扩张公式集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to,\\leftrightarrow\\}\">\\(\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to,\\leftrightarrow\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\in\\{\\exists,\\forall\\}\">\\(Q\\in\\{\\exists,\\forall\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\">\\(x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\)</span>；不是把带扩张子式的公式直接交给纯FO的满足函数。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal X_{k,a}\\coloneqq\\left\\{(\\bar x_1,\\ldots,\\bar x_a)\\in(\\mathrm{Var}^k)^a\\ \\middle|\\ \\operatorname{card}\\left(\\bigcup_{h=1}^a\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar x_h)\\right)=ka\\right\\},\\qquad X(\\mathsf X)\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{h=1}^a\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar x_h).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal X_{k,a}\\coloneqq\\left\\{(\\bar x_1,\\ldots,\\bar x_a)\\in(\\mathrm{Var}^k)^a\\ \\middle|\\ \\operatorname{card}\\left(\\bigcup_{h=1}^a\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar x_h)\\right)=ka\\right\\},\\qquad X(\\mathsf X)\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{h=1}^a\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar x_h).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F^0_\\sigma\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Fml}_\\sigma,\\qquad\\mathrm{FV}(\\phi)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}_\\sigma(\\phi)\\quad(\\phi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_\\sigma).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal F^0_\\sigma\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Fml}_\\sigma,\\qquad\\mathrm{FV}(\\phi)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}_\\sigma(\\phi)\\quad(\\phi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_\\sigma).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"D_{\\mathsf X,\\Phi}^{A,\\beta}\\coloneqq\\{\\bar b\\in|A|^k\\mid A\\models_{\\mathbf s,\\mathfrak D}\\phi_0[\\beta[\\bar b/\\bar x_1]]\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[D_{\\mathsf X,\\Phi}^{A,\\beta}\\coloneqq\\{\\bar b\\in|A|^k\\mid A\\models_{\\mathbf s,\\mathfrak D}\\phi_0[\\beta[\\bar b/\\bar x_1]]\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"R_{i,\\mathsf X,\\Phi}^{A,\\beta}\\coloneqq\\{(\\bar b_1,\\ldots,\\bar b_{a_i})\\in(D_{\\mathsf X,\\Phi}^{A,\\beta})^{a_i}\\mid A\\models_{\\mathbf s,\\mathfrak D}\\phi_i[\\beta[\\bar b_1,\\ldots,\\bar b_{a_i}/\\bar x_1,\\ldots,\\bar x_{a_i}]]\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[R_{i,\\mathsf X,\\Phi}^{A,\\beta}\\coloneqq\\{(\\bar b_1,\\ldots,\\bar b_{a_i})\\in(D_{\\mathsf X,\\Phi}^{A,\\beta})^{a_i}\\mid A\\models_{\\mathbf s,\\mathfrak D}\\phi_i[\\beta[\\bar b_1,\\ldots,\\bar b_{a_i}/\\bar x_1,\\ldots,\\bar x_{a_i}]]\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Good}(A,\\beta,\\mathsf X,\\Phi)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ D_{\\mathsf X,\\Phi}^{A,\\beta}\\ne\\varnothing\\land\\bigwedge_{l=1}^s\\exists!\\bar b\\in D_{\\mathsf X,\\Phi}^{A,\\beta}\\;A\\models_{\\mathbf s,\\mathfrak D}\\psi_l[\\beta[\\bar b/\\bar x_1]].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Good}(A,\\beta,\\mathsf X,\\Phi)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ D_{\\mathsf X,\\Phi}^{A,\\beta}\\ne\\varnothing\\land\\bigwedge_{l=1}^s\\exists!\\bar b\\in D_{\\mathsf X,\\Phi}^{A,\\beta}\\;A\\models_{\\mathbf s,\\mathfrak D}\\psi_l[\\beta[\\bar b/\\bar x_1]].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"I_{\\mathsf X,\\Phi}(A,\\beta)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\iota B\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\;\\left(|B|=D_{\\mathsf X,\\Phi}^{A,\\beta}\\land\\bigwedge_{i=1}^r R_i^B=R_{i,\\mathsf X,\\Phi}^{A,\\beta}\\land\\bigwedge_{l=1}^s\\left(c_l^B\\in D_{\\mathsf X,\\Phi}^{A,\\beta}\\land A\\models_{\\mathbf s,\\mathfrak D}\\psi_l[\\beta[c_l^B/\\bar x_1]]\\right)\\right),&amp;\\operatorname{Good}(A,\\beta,\\mathsf X,\\Phi),\\\\\\varnothing,&amp;\\neg\\operatorname{Good}(A,\\beta,\\mathsf X,\\Phi).\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[I_{\\mathsf X,\\Phi}(A,\\beta)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\iota B\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\;\\left(|B|=D_{\\mathsf X,\\Phi}^{A,\\beta}\\land\\bigwedge_{i=1}^r R_i^B=R_{i,\\mathsf X,\\Phi}^{A,\\beta}\\land\\bigwedge_{l=1}^s\\left(c_l^B\\in D_{\\mathsf X,\\Phi}^{A,\\beta}\\land A\\models_{\\mathbf s,\\mathfrak D}\\psi_l[\\beta[c_l^B/\\bar x_1]]\\right)\\right),&amp;\\operatorname{Good}(A,\\beta,\\mathsf X,\\Phi),\\\\\\varnothing,&amp;\\neg\\operatorname{Good}(A,\\beta,\\mathsf X,\\Phi).\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Spec}_k^j[\\sigma,\\tau]\\coloneqq\\left\\{(\\mathsf X,\\Phi)\\ \\middle|\\ \\begin{aligned}&amp;\\mathsf X\\in\\mathcal X_{k,a}\\land\\{\\phi_0,\\ldots,\\phi_r,\\psi_1,\\ldots,\\psi_s\\}\\subseteq\\mathcal F^j_\\sigma,\\\\&amp;\\exists Z\\subseteq\\mathrm{Var}\\setminus X(\\mathsf X)\\;\\left(\\operatorname{card}(Z)&lt;\\aleph_0\\land\\mathrm{FV}(\\phi_0)\\cup\\bigcup_{l=1}^s\\mathrm{FV}(\\psi_l)\\subseteq\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar x_1)\\cup Z\\land\\bigwedge_{i=1}^r\\mathrm{FV}(\\phi_i)\\subseteq\\bigcup_{h\\leq a_i}\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar x_h)\\cup Z\\right),\\\\&amp;\\forall A\\in\\mathcal D_\\sigma\\;\\forall\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(A)\\;\\left(\\operatorname{Good}(A,\\beta,\\mathsf X,\\Phi)\\land I_{\\mathsf X,\\Phi}(A,\\beta)\\in\\mathcal D_\\tau\\right)\\end{aligned}\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Spec}_k^j[\\sigma,\\tau]\\coloneqq\\left\\{(\\mathsf X,\\Phi)\\ \\middle|\\ \\begin{aligned}&amp;\\mathsf X\\in\\mathcal X_{k,a}\\land\\{\\phi_0,\\ldots,\\phi_r,\\psi_1,\\ldots,\\psi_s\\}\\subseteq\\mathcal F^j_\\sigma,\\\\&amp;\\exists Z\\subseteq\\mathrm{Var}\\setminus X(\\mathsf X)\\;\\left(\\operatorname{card}(Z)&lt;\\aleph_0\\land\\mathrm{FV}(\\phi_0)\\cup\\bigcup_{l=1}^s\\mathrm{FV}(\\psi_l)\\subseteq\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar x_1)\\cup Z\\land\\bigwedge_{i=1}^r\\mathrm{FV}(\\phi_i)\\subseteq\\bigcup_{h\\leq a_i}\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar x_h)\\cup Z\\right),\\\\&amp;\\forall A\\in\\mathcal D_\\sigma\\;\\forall\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(A)\\;\\left(\\operatorname{Good}(A,\\beta,\\mathsf X,\\Phi)\\land I_{\\mathsf X,\\Phi}(A,\\beta)\\in\\mathcal D_\\tau\\right)\\end{aligned}\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F^{j+1}_\\sigma\\coloneqq\\mathcal F^j_\\sigma\\cup\\{\\neg\\phi,\\phi\\circ\\psi,Qx\\,\\phi\\mid\\phi,\\psi\\in\\mathcal F^j_\\sigma,\\ x\\in\\mathrm{Var},\\ \\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to,\\leftrightarrow\\},\\ Q\\in\\{\\exists,\\forall\\}\\}\\cup\\{Q_{\\mathbf s}[\\mathsf X;\\Phi]\\mid k\\geq1,\\ (\\mathsf X,\\Phi)\\in\\mathrm{Spec}_k^j[\\sigma,\\tau]\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal F^{j+1}_\\sigma\\coloneqq\\mathcal F^j_\\sigma\\cup\\{\\neg\\phi,\\phi\\circ\\psi,Qx\\,\\phi\\mid\\phi,\\psi\\in\\mathcal F^j_\\sigma,\\ x\\in\\mathrm{Var},\\ \\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to,\\leftrightarrow\\},\\ Q\\in\\{\\exists,\\forall\\}\\}\\cup\\{Q_{\\mathbf s}[\\mathsf X;\\Phi]\\mid k\\geq1,\\ (\\mathsf X,\\Phi)\\in\\mathrm{Spec}_k^j[\\sigma,\\tau]\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\models_{\\mathbf s,\\mathfrak D}Q_{\\mathbf s}[\\mathsf X;\\Phi][\\beta]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ I_{\\mathsf X,\\Phi}(A,\\beta)\\in S.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\models_{\\mathbf s,\\mathfrak D}Q_{\\mathbf s}[\\mathsf X;\\Phi][\\beta]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ I_{\\mathsf X,\\Phi}(A,\\beta)\\in S.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}(Q_{\\mathbf s}[\\mathsf X;\\Phi])\\coloneqq\\left(\\bigcup_{i=0}^r\\mathrm{FV}(\\phi_i)\\cup\\bigcup_{l=1}^s\\mathrm{FV}(\\psi_l)\\right)\\setminus X(\\mathsf X).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{FV}(Q_{\\mathbf s}[\\mathsf X;\\Phi])\\coloneqq\\left(\\bigcup_{i=0}^r\\mathrm{FV}(\\phi_i)\\cup\\bigcup_{l=1}^s\\mathrm{FV}(\\psi_l)\\right)\\setminus X(\\mathsf X).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{FO}(Q_{\\mathbf s}),\\mathfrak D}[\\sigma]\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{j\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathcal F^j_\\sigma,\\qquad\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{FO}(Q_{\\mathbf s}),\\mathfrak D}[\\sigma]\\coloneqq\\{\\phi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{FO}(Q_{\\mathbf s}),\\mathfrak D}[\\sigma]\\mid\\mathrm{FV}(\\phi)=\\varnothing\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{FO}(Q_{\\mathbf s}),\\mathfrak D}[\\sigma]\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{j\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathcal F^j_\\sigma,\\qquad\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{FO}(Q_{\\mathbf s}),\\mathfrak D}[\\sigma]\\coloneqq\\{\\phi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{FO}(Q_{\\mathbf s}),\\mathfrak D}[\\sigma]\\mid\\mathrm{FV}(\\phi)=\\varnothing\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}(\\alpha)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}_{\\sigma}(\\alpha),\\quad\\mathrm{FV}(\\neg\\phi)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}(\\phi),\\quad\\mathrm{FV}(\\phi\\circ\\psi)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}(\\phi)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}(\\psi),\\quad\\mathrm{FV}(Qx\\,\\phi)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}(\\phi)\\setminus\\{x\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{FV}(\\alpha)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}_{\\sigma}(\\alpha),\\quad\\mathrm{FV}(\\neg\\phi)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}(\\phi),\\quad\\mathrm{FV}(\\phi\\circ\\psi)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}(\\phi)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}(\\psi),\\quad\\mathrm{FV}(Qx\\,\\phi)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}(\\phi)\\setminus\\{x\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\models_{\\mathbf s,\\mathfrak D}\\alpha[\\beta]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ A\\models\\alpha[\\beta],\\qquad A\\models_{\\mathbf s,\\mathfrak D}(\\neg\\phi)[\\beta]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\neg(A\\models_{\\mathbf s,\\mathfrak D}\\phi[\\beta]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\models_{\\mathbf s,\\mathfrak D}\\alpha[\\beta]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ A\\models\\alpha[\\beta],\\qquad A\\models_{\\mathbf s,\\mathfrak D}(\\neg\\phi)[\\beta]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\neg(A\\models_{\\mathbf s,\\mathfrak D}\\phi[\\beta]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\models_{\\mathbf s,\\mathfrak D}(\\phi\\land\\psi)[\\beta]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ (A\\models_{\\mathbf s,\\mathfrak D}\\phi[\\beta]\\land A\\models_{\\mathbf s,\\mathfrak D}\\psi[\\beta]),\\qquad A\\models_{\\mathbf s,\\mathfrak D}(\\phi\\lor\\psi)[\\beta]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ (A\\models_{\\mathbf s,\\mathfrak D}\\phi[\\beta]\\lor A\\models_{\\mathbf s,\\mathfrak D}\\psi[\\beta]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\models_{\\mathbf s,\\mathfrak D}(\\phi\\land\\psi)[\\beta]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ (A\\models_{\\mathbf s,\\mathfrak D}\\phi[\\beta]\\land A\\models_{\\mathbf s,\\mathfrak D}\\psi[\\beta]),\\qquad A\\models_{\\mathbf s,\\mathfrak D}(\\phi\\lor\\psi)[\\beta]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ (A\\models_{\\mathbf s,\\mathfrak D}\\phi[\\beta]\\lor A\\models_{\\mathbf s,\\mathfrak D}\\psi[\\beta]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\models_{\\mathbf s,\\mathfrak D}(\\phi\\to\\psi)[\\beta]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ (A\\models_{\\mathbf s,\\mathfrak D}\\phi[\\beta]\\to A\\models_{\\mathbf s,\\mathfrak D}\\psi[\\beta]),\\qquad A\\models_{\\mathbf s,\\mathfrak D}(\\phi\\leftrightarrow\\psi)[\\beta]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ ((A\\models_{\\mathbf s,\\mathfrak D}\\phi[\\beta])\\leftrightarrow(A\\models_{\\mathbf s,\\mathfrak D}\\psi[\\beta])).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\models_{\\mathbf s,\\mathfrak D}(\\phi\\to\\psi)[\\beta]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ (A\\models_{\\mathbf s,\\mathfrak D}\\phi[\\beta]\\to A\\models_{\\mathbf s,\\mathfrak D}\\psi[\\beta]),\\qquad A\\models_{\\mathbf s,\\mathfrak D}(\\phi\\leftrightarrow\\psi)[\\beta]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ ((A\\models_{\\mathbf s,\\mathfrak D}\\phi[\\beta])\\leftrightarrow(A\\models_{\\mathbf s,\\mathfrak D}\\psi[\\beta])).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\models_{\\mathbf s,\\mathfrak D}(\\exists x\\,\\phi)[\\beta]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists a\\in|A|\\;A\\models_{\\mathbf s,\\mathfrak D}\\phi[\\beta[a/x]],\\qquad A\\models_{\\mathbf s,\\mathfrak D}(\\forall x\\,\\phi)[\\beta]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall a\\in|A|\\;A\\models_{\\mathbf s,\\mathfrak D}\\phi[\\beta[a/x]].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\models_{\\mathbf s,\\mathfrak D}(\\exists x\\,\\phi)[\\beta]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists a\\in|A|\\;A\\models_{\\mathbf s,\\mathfrak D}\\phi[\\beta[a/x]],\\qquad A\\models_{\\mathbf s,\\mathfrak D}(\\forall x\\,\\phi)[\\beta]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall a\\in|A|\\;A\\models_{\\mathbf s,\\mathfrak D}\\phi[\\beta[a/x]].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\models_{\\mathbf s,\\mathfrak D}\\phi\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(A)\\;A\\models_{\\mathbf s,\\mathfrak D}\\phi[\\beta],\\qquad\\mathrm{FV}(\\phi)=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\models_{\\mathbf s,\\mathfrak D}\\phi\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(A)\\;A\\models_{\\mathbf s,\\mathfrak D}\\phi[\\beta],\\qquad\\mathrm{FV}(\\phi)=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Definition11.20（印刷178、扫描193）给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\models Q_S(I)\\iff I(A)\\in S\">\\(A\\models Q_S(I)\\iff I(A)\\in S\\)</span>，并说明它绑定解释中的元组变量。本条显式补足参数、嵌套与合法输出要求；没有把仅能容纳FO公式体的FOQuery直接用于含广义量词的公式体。第一层体为FO，后续层允许嵌套，但每次只依赖严格较小的公式树，故满足递归良基；出现于不同层的同一公式有相同解释。</p>\n<p>全部域、关系和解释签名显式保留绑定组 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf X\">\\(\\mathsf X\\)</span>，避免同一公式体换绑定变量后误取相同解释。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X(\\mathsf X)\">\\(X(\\mathsf X)\\)</span> 是全部坐标变量之集合，不能把元组自身当作一个变量。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal X_{k,a}\">\\(\\mathcal X_{k,a}\\)</span> 的基数条件同时保证组内与组间变量不同。Spec 内部绑定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z\">\\(Z\\)</span>，其不同选择仅作为形成条件的见证，不改变最终语法节点或其语义。</p>\n<p>合法性对每个输入及赋值要求非空域、常量唯一性和输出属于指定目标类。这是语义上合法解释的形成条件，不声称这个条件的语法检查可判定。Good 成立时每个关系解释由集合构造确定，每个常量由唯一见证确定，故目标结构的定描述存在唯一；Good 不成立时返回不是结构的空集，使整个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_{\\mathsf X,\\Phi}\">\\(I_{\\mathsf X,\\Phi}\\)</span> 仍有确定值，Spec 中的合取不再求值一个未定义项。合法量词节点永远不会进入这一非法分支。结构同构及赋值搬运对公式树归纳，保证所得句子定义同构封闭查询。一般结构与标准数值结构采用不同的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak D\">\\(\\mathfrak D\\)</span>，不能在同一论证中暗换论域。</p>\n<p>本次来源边界：以上原书定位与过往核对叙述继承自所给文件，不表示本次重新查看了原书或完成机器证明；本次修补以现有文本的类型、条件和依赖闭合为依据。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]"